  "nativeSourceBoundary": "Both engine source receipts use the same immutable allocation-r2 manifest (191 inputs), plus their two copied diagnostic files. Root production edits after that freeze are not compiled into these artifacts.",
  "verifiedHookFacts": [
    "JobQueue exposes getHostDefinedData and getHostDefinedGlobal; no getIncumbentGlobal in this header.",
    "Pending reaction/native/await records capture host-defined data; settled records may optimize it out.",
    "Use-js-microtask-queue defaults true in the shipped generated preferences; legacy queue selection is a supported non-startup preference setter.",
    "js::RunJobs dispatches cx->jobQueue->runJobs; the Starling normal and finalizer checkpoints use this API.",
    "AllocationMetadataBuilder requires same-realm objects and treats callback/table errors as fatal; it occupies one realm builder slot.",
    "Native-reserved reaction holder and 11-slot PromiseReactionRecord read are private pinned layout, not a stable ABI."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Only content/initializer realm inputs were exercised; wrapped promises can skip the v1/v2 creation-metadata choice.",
    "Unknown native job payloads fall back in the diagnostic; arbitrary other job kinds are not covered.",
    "No production AsyncLocalStorage or complete AsyncResource/async_hooks module is implemented by these probes."
  ]
